      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Redford- Make the Move\r\n\r\nWelcome to Redford – Your New Beginning in Adamstown\r\n\r\nWelcome to The Express, a beautifully designed four-bedroom home spread over three floors, offering approx. 150 sqm (1,614 sqft) of thoughtfully planned living space. Designed for comfort and modern living, this stunning home provides a perfect balance of style, space, and functionality.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the ground floor, you’ll find a welcoming entrance hall with a WC and a convenient utility room. The heart of the home is the large open-plan kitchen, dining, and sitting area, featuring double doors leading to a private garden, perfect for seamless indoor-outdoor living.\r\n\r\nAscending to the first floor, you’ll discover a spacious double bedroom with ensuite, and sitting room, offering an ideal retreat for relaxation or additional entertainment space.\r\n\r\nThe second floor is home to two further large double bedrooms and a single bedroom alongside a family bathroom"
      }
